{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c5af","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b3c6-628c-70a3-ad39-75274b1adfea"},"sequence":306,"recorded_at":1780531400000607,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"94f324ce-ad7a-4eb7-9c54-86bfc93d2b24","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"94f324ce-ad7a-4eb7-9c54-86bfc93d2b24","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"94f324ce-ad7a-4eb7-9c54-86bfc93d2b24"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b3c7-3259-7f83-ab50-79fbfc85ddef"},"task_id":"01a0b3c7-3259-7f83-ab50-79fbfc85ddef","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b3c7-3259-7f83-ab50-79fbfc85ddef","chunk":"Read text file `/tmp/t32ypr2/results-rev1.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-32ypr2 Results — test-unknown-encrypted-and-incomplete-events\n2|\n3|Status: ready for review. Candidate left UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree\n4|(`task-board/story/STORY-260830-1cyj0q`); no commit on the Story branch.\n5|Branch tip after refresh: `3005d78` (replayed `TASK-260830-2g5be6`\n6|checkpoint over trunk `c3aae73`); `origin/main` is `c3aae73` at handoff.\n7|\n8|## Start-of-run recovery (refresh FIRST)\n9|\n10|This run opened on stale base `a12d1bd` (branch tip `47294bb`, the\n11|`TASK-260830-2g5be6` checkpoint) while the selected authority was trunk\n12|`c3aae73` — the exact shape that refused the previous attempt's CR\n13|construction (`change_request_base_authority_mismatch`). Per the brief,\n14|`task-board worktree refresh-candidate TASK-260830-32ypr2` ran FIRST:\n15|\n16|- First attempt stopped for one regular-file conflict (`LOGBOOK.md`, replay\n17|  of `47294bb` onto `c3aae73`).\n18|- Resolution `--replay-resolutions /tmp/replay-resolutions.json`, binding\n19|  `checkpoint_oid 47294bb816429fa83e07e9889605201b35d7f045`,\n20|  `path LOGBOOK.md`,\n21|  `sha256 68ccfc48ccbecd0c915b0b2ce1e316f76816aa0ca0ca34bfb560489493a4a299`\n22|  (trunk's `STORY-260830-4qojoz` entry kept newest-first, the `2g