N-unknown-kind-wholly`, `N-reasons-both-single`, `N-native-reason-foreign`\n56|  (each headline foreign/unknown test now has a directly-reddening\n57|  narrowing), and `N-main-parent` with a new `ParentActorID == nil`\n58|  assertion in `TestNormalizeSealsSessionShape` (the brief names main-null\n59|  explicitly; the landed builder enforces it and the wiring is now narrowed\n60|  too). Plus one verified cross-kill probe (below).\n61|- Rebuilt the story-close half as a merge with trunk's mesh-RPC story\n62|  (below), replacing the predecessor's stale-base drafts.\n63|\n64|## Delivered\n65|\n66|`internal/cloneproject` (new package, 6 production files + 6 test files +\n67|TRACEABILITY.md + harness): the §13.14.1 projection-fidelity closure over\n68|captured bytes. `Normalize` derives a Canonical Session + Canonical Events\n69|from the sealed Clone Capture Manifest, its sealed Clone Raw Object\n70|Manifest, and digest/size-verified blob bytes. Unknown native types and\n71|unknown-class members become raw-addressable `opaque_event` records;\n72|foreign encrypted/signed reasoning becomes byte-exact `opaque_reasoning`;\n73|foreign instructions pin `low` authority and never reach the effective\n74|snapshot; tool calls resolve `completed` only with their result, else\n75|`aborted` history with an always-empty live surface; source usage counts\n76|source-only; text over 64 KiB becomes an installed overflow blob reference.\n77|Every event and the session seal through the landed `clonebundle` builders\n78|and re-decode before return; the only durable write is overflow installation\n79|through the `localstore` no-replace discipline. No `ax` command, `doctor`\n80|result, or runtime capability is claimed anywhere.\n81|\n82|## AC coverage: 24 of 24 rows driven and measured\n83|\n84|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_conformance-matrix.md` (attached) enumerates every row:\n85|the driving test(s) through `Normalize`, the production call site, and the\n86|narrowing(s) reddening the killer(s). Headlines:\n87|\n88|- Unknown → opaque (rows 1–5): wholly-unknown, almost-known\n89|  (`message/smoke` never coerced), whole-member, byte-exact resolution,\n90|  twice-projected stability — each kind gate narrowed.\n91|- Foreign reasoning (rows 6–10): encrypted + signed `opaque_reasoning`\n92|  with forbidden-member sweeps, native-protected codeless, protected-known\n93|  never semantic, both-reasons, low-authority instructions, source-only\n94|  usage — every test has a directly-reddening plant except the\n95|  protected-message test, whose shared-gate plant (`N-protection-encrypted`)\n96|  is verified to kill it by the logged hand probe\n97|  (`crosskill-encrypted-vs-protected-message.log`: exit 1 under the plant\n98|  with `--- FAIL: TestNormalizeProtectedMessageBecomesOpaqueEvent`,\n99|  `ok` on restored bytes, `cmp`-verified restore).\n100|- Tools (rows 11–17): full matrix (call±result, orphan, post-boundary,\n101|  nested subagent) with kinds, visibilities, and empty live surface —\n102|  incomplete calls narrowed at both the pairing and the pending gates.\n103|- Closed shapes (rows 18–21): ordinals/parents/actors/head, exact evidence\n104|  + stable reasons, the 65536/65537 edge, session shape incl. main-null —\n105|  sealed through landed builders, shape internals owned by the accepted\n106|  clonebundle suite (matrix states the split per member).\n107|- Cross-cutting (rows 22–24): determinism (byte-identical twice), the\n108|  33-row refusal table + unstable + drift entries (one narrowing per\n109|  family), no-partial-bundle failure + idempotent replay (blob count\n110|  stable; write crash semantics owned by landed `localstore`).\n111|\n112|## Mutants\n113|\n114|`internal/cloneproject/testdata/mutant_harness.py`: 49 narrowing rows +\n115|harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED control. Battery executed TWICE on the\n116|final tree, exit 0 both runs, 50/50 `ok:` lines each, one raw log per plant\n117|per run carrying the mutant identity, patch, subprocess exit, and FA