16|owners in the matrix, section D.\n217|\n218|## Handoff state\n219|\n220|Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree for the handoff snapshot.\n221|Checklist: all 14 producer items verified true this run and checked\n222|(evidence above + attached). Attached: `TASK-260830-32ypr2_results.md`\n223|(this file), `TASK-260830-32ypr2_conformance-matrix.md`,\n224|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (real gzip: 30 command logs,\n225|7 race-group logs, package logs, 2×50 per-plant logs, 2 battery logs,\n226|cross-kill probe log, section-run logs, `MANIFEST.sha256`).","final_result":true}}}
