188|  zero `DATA RACE`, zero FAIL; `sessquery` alone in group G), each with\n189|  `-timeout 25m`, instead of one long call per the headless time bound.\n190|- 6 cover gate: 0 — 41 `ok`; `cloneproject` 88.9% of statements.\n191|- 7–23 fuzz gates (rpcwire ×4, scalar ×1, canonicaljson ×4,\n192|  secconftest ×8, each `-fuzztime=100x -parallel=1`): all 0.\n193|- 24 tracecheck: 0 (ratio above). 25 cataloggen `-adopted … -check`: 0.\n194|- 26 linux build: 0. 27 windows build: 0. 28 JSON parse sweep: 0.\n195|- 29 `task-board validate`: 0 (182 pre-existing board-hygiene notes,\n196|  `MISSING_ACTIVITY` on unrelated elements, none from this task).\n197|- 30 `git diff --check`: 0.\n198|- Package evidence on the final tree: `pkg-cloneproject.log` (25 tests,\n199|  all PASS), `pkg-cloneproject-cover.log` (88.9%),\n200|  `pkg-cloneproject-race.log` (`ok`), `pkg-siblings.log`\n201|  (clonebundle + clonesnap `ok`), `pkg-traceability.log` (both suites\n202|  `ok`). The only post-suite file changes before these package runs were\n203|  the harness/testdata/test assertion additions, which the re-runs cover.\n204|\n205|## Bounds (sibling scope, not waived)\n206|\n207|Fixture-native envelope is test-defined framing (body shapes exact,\n208|envelope extras unclaimed); registries cover exactly the ten emitted kinds;\n209|native-protected records carry no reason code; turns/times null; call\n210|arguments not carried; `partial`/`synthesized`/`unavailable` and non-text\n211|blocks never emitted (shape rules owned by the accepted clonebundle\n212|suite); the §13.14.2 reason vocabulary is referenced, not owned;\n213|§13.14.2–13.14.5 (dispositions, planning, lineage, bundle chain,\n214|transaction, tuple admission) sibling-owned; §7.8 operation frames stay\n215|`sessadapter`; write crash semantics stay `localstore`. Full table with\n216|owners in the matrix, section D.\n217|\n218|## Handoff state\n219|\n220|Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree for the handoff snapshot.\n221|Checklist: all 14 producer items verified true this run and checked\n222|(evidence above + attached). Attached: `TASK-260830-32ypr2_results.md`\n223|(this file), `TASK-260830-32ypr2_conformance-matrix.md`,\n224|`TASK-260830-32ypr2_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (real gzip: 30 command logs,\n225|7 race-group logs, package logs, 2×50 per-plant logs, 2 battery logs,\n226|cross-kill probe log, section-run logs, `MANIFEST.sha256`).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
